202
00:15:20,180 --> 00:15:23,180
I have no mana to speak of and no way to defend myself.

203
00:15:24,180 --> 00:15:26,180
I don't age, but I'm probably not immortal.

204
00:15:27,180 --> 00:15:28,180
Right.

205
00:15:29,180 --> 00:15:30,180
I honestly can't stand this world.

206
