I actually like this world.

212
00:15:52,180 --> 00:15:53,180
I don't want to go back.

213
00:15:54,180 --> 00:15:56,180
You didn't leave behind a family or anything?

214
00:16:00,180 --> 00:16:02,180
I have no regrets. I'm home.

215
00:16:05,180 --> 00:16:07,180
You must have had a good long life then.

216
00:16:13,180 --> 00:16:17,180
Well, we clearly have different goals. There's no denying that.

217
00:16:18,180 --> 00:16:21,180
But we both have something to offer each other.

218
00:16:22,180 --> 00:16:24,180
