228
00:16:56,180 --> 00:16:58,180
Let's do it. I'm happy to accept.

229
00:16:59,180 --> 00:17:00,180
Glad to hear it.

230
00:17:01,180 --> 00:17:04,180
But just so we're clear, no backing out or changing your mind later, okay?

231
