No! Why?

262
00:18:46,180 --> 00:18:48,180
She just admitted it was her fault!

263
00:18:49,180 --> 00:18:51,180
Why would you hold me back?

264
00:18:51,180 --> 00:18:52,180
You suffered too!

265
00:18:52,180 --> 00:18:54,180
I know you suffered just like the rest of us!

266
00:18:54,180 --> 00:18:55,180
No, I'm sorry!

267
00:18:56,180 --> 00:18:57,180
We didn't explain this clearly enough.

268
00:18:58,180 --> 00:18:59,180
She didn't choose to come here.

269
00:19:00,180 --> 00:19:01,180
She's a victim too!

270
00:19:03,180 --> 00:19:04,180
Is that true?

271
00:19:07,180 --> 00:19:09,180
I misunderstood.

272
00:19:10,180 --> 00:19:11,180
I'm sorry.

273
00:19:11,180 --> 00:19:12,180
I could have phrased that better.

274
00:19:13,180 --> 00:19:14,180
Forgive me.

275
00:19:16,180 --> 00:19:17,180
No.

276
00:19:18,180 --> 00:19:20,180
I apologize for jumping to conclusions.

277
00:19:24,180 --> 00:19:25,180
Anyway,

278
00:19:26,180 --> 00:19:28,180
I don't know much more about the incident itself.

279
00:19:28,180 --> 00:19:30,180
Not who would have brought me here,

280
00:19:30,180 --> 00:19:31,180
or what they hoped to gain,

281
00:19:31,180 --> 00:19:33,180
or why it led to such a disaster.

282
00:19:35,180 --> 00:19:37,180
What did Orsted have to say about it?

283
00:19:38,180 --> 00:19:39,180
That it had never happened before.

284
00:19:39,180 --> 00:19:40,180
That's all.

285
00:19:41,180 --> 00:19:42,180
Okay.

286
00:19:42,180 --> 00:19:45,180
I feel like the man-god told me it was Orsted's fault, though.

287
00:19:46,180 --> 00:19:48,180
Then, why did you say that you caused it?

288
00:19:49,180 --> 00:19:50,180
Well, I did in a sense.

289
00:19:51,180 --> 00:19:53,180
And I wanted to get that fact out in the open right away.

290
00:19:54,180 --> 00:19:56,180
Don't need anyone using it against me down the road.

291
00:19:59,180 --> 00:20:00,180
I understand.

292
00:20:00,180 --> 00:20:03,180
Anyway, I have a plan to move forward with my research from here.

293
00:20:03,180 --> 00:20:04,180
And if my work succeeds,

294
00:20:04,180 --> 00:20:08,180
I should be able to explain the mass teleportation logically, at least.

295
00:20:09,180 --> 00:20:11,180
But to even get that far, I'll need a lot of mana.

296
00:20:11,180 --> 00:20:12,180
I see.

297
00:20:12,180 --> 00:20:14,180
So I must be a godsend, then.

298
00:20:15,180 --> 00:20:16,180
A godsend?

299
00:20:17,180 --> 00:20:19,180
You may be right.

300
00:20:20,180 --> 00:20:22,180
That's about enough for today.

301
00:20:23,180 --> 00:20:24,180
I need to think some things over.

302
00:20:25,180 --> 00:20:26,180
Can I come back in a few days?

303
00:20:27,180 --> 00:20:28,180
Okay.

304
00:20:28,180 --> 00:20:30,180
I'm tired from talking so much anyway.

305
00:20:31,180 --> 00:20:33,180
I'll see you around.

306
00:20:33,180 --> 00:20:34,180
I'll see you around.

307
00:21:03,180 --> 00:21:04,180
Rudeus?

308
00:21:08,180 --> 00:21:10,180
What do you think about her, really?

309
00:21:11,180 --> 00:21:12,180
Hm?

310
00:21:15,180 --> 00:21:18,180
To be honest, some things about her rub me the wrong way.

311
00:21:19,180 --> 00:21:21,180
But for the time being, I trust her.

312
00:21:22,180 --> 00:21:23,180
Is that so?

313
00:21:24,180 --> 00:21:25,180
Well...

314
00:21:29,180 --> 00:21:30,180
Alright.

315
00:21:31,180 --> 00:21:32,180
I trust you.

316
00:21:33,180 --> 00:21:41,180
You were worried about me, weren't you?

317
00:21:42,180 --> 00:21:43,180
Thank you.

318
00:21:44,180 --> 00:21:45,180
Oh...

319
00:21:45,180 --> 00:21:47,180
No, I wasn't exactly...

320
00:21:48,180 --> 00:21:49,180
Well...

321
00:21:50,180 --> 00:21:51,180
Yes.

322
00:21:51,180 --> 00:21:52,180
You're welcome.

323
00:22:03,180 --> 00:22:04,180
I want to?

324
00:22:04,180 --> 00:22:07,180
Two.

325
00:22:07,180 --> 00:22:08,180
Two wilkins,

326
00:22:08,180 --> 00:22:09,180
One, three...

327
00:22:10,180 --> 00:22:12,180
Two Zakies.

328
00:22:13,180 --> 00:22:14,180
One is about nine...

329
00:22:15,180 --> 00:22:16,180
Three to five...

330
00:22:16,180 --> 00:22:21,180
One is about nine.

331
00:23:35,980 --> 00:23:39,980
La-ya-la-ya-la

